          "type": "strong",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Tutorial"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " play button. Card, ArcGIS Upload, Custom Layers, Basemap, Watershed, card creation, and detail views provide their own guides where available. Help buttons open the manual. Tutorials explain controls; complete and submit the actual form to save data."
